WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.490
Unit eleven. Environmental Action!

2
00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:11.536
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level four!

3
00:00:11.586 --> 00:00:15.156
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.206 --> 00:00:19.358
Today we learn: Environmental Action. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.165 --> 00:00:25.898
Carbon footprint. Say it with me. Carbon footprint!

6
00:00:29.444 --> 00:00:33.744
Zero waste. Say it with me. Zero waste!

7
00:00:37.246 --> 00:00:42.029
Renewable resource. Say it with me. Renewable resource!

8
00:00:45.499 --> 00:00:49.299
Activism. Say it with me. Activism!

9
00:00:52.754 --> 00:00:56.170
Petition. Say it with me. Petition!

10
00:00:59.654 --> 00:01:04.788
Sustainability goal. Say it with me. Sustainability goal!

11
00:01:08.347 --> 00:01:12.581
Green initiative. Say it with me. Green initiative!

12
00:01:16.025 --> 00:01:20.258
Climate strike. Say it with me. Climate strike!

13
00:01:23.818 --> 00:01:28.502
Eco-conscious. Say it with me. Eco-conscious!

14
00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:36.336
Policy change. Say it with me. Policy change!

15
00:01:39.896 --> 00:01:44.112
Advocacy. Say it with me. Advocacy!

16
00:01:47.563 --> 00:01:51.029
Impact. Say it with me. Impact!

17
00:01:54.572 --> 00:02:03.664
Grammar time! Third conditional. Listen. If we had acted sooner, the impact would have been smaller.

18
00:02:03.714 --> 00:02:09.557
Your turn. Say it with me. If we had acted sooner, the impact would have been smaller.

19
00:02:14.446 --> 00:02:23.769
Reducing my carbon footprint through zero waste habits makes an impact. Youth activism and eco-conscious choices can lead to real policy change.

20
00:02:23.819 --> 00:02:25.303
I like this story!

21
00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:31.945
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:31.995 --> 00:02:33.608
Renewable resource!

23
00:02:34.624 --> 00:02:39.828
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:39.878 --> 00:02:41.313
Green initiative!

25
00:02:42.249 --> 00:02:51.509
Think and answer. What environmental action would you like to take part in?

26
00:02:51.559 --> 00:02:52.734
Great answer!

27
00:02:53.923 --> 00:02:58.093
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
00:02:58.143 --> 00:02:59.708
Bye-bye, friends!

